      "updated": 1777824828659,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ansible.cfg\n\n\n\n\ninventory : use dynamic inventory for AWS hosts\ninventory/aws_ec2.yml\n\nprivate_key_file : key for provisioning\n./keys/ansible-key.pem\n\nhost_key_checking :Don't prompt fingerprint confirmation\n\nRemoved vault_password_file = ~/.ansible_vault_pass\nI don’t want plain-text password file\nwill use --ask-vault-pass instead\n\nenable_plugins = amazon.aws.aws_ec2, yaml, ini",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ansible.cfg\n\n\n\n\ninventory : use dynamic inventory for AWS hosts\ninventory/aws_ec2.yml\n\nprivate_key_file : key for provisioning\n./keys/ansible-key.pem\n\nhost_key_checking :Don't prompt fingerprint confirmation\n\nRemoved vault_password_file = ~/.ansible_vault_pass\nI don’t want plain-text password file\nwill use --ask-vault-pass instead\n\nenable_plugins = amazon.aws.aws_ec2, yaml, ini",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
