    {
      "id": "gRcYTLgWH008b42IxaT0N",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2754.5520833333353,
      "y": -2023.4120670995683,
      "width": 582.0666910807295,
      "height": 770,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b50",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 407427522,
      "version": 289,
      "versionNonce": 1643147742,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1777736651003,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "playbooks/provision.yml\n\nHow the playbook runs: run on local\nmachine\n\nLoad Vault\nReuseable AWS credentials\n\nCreate SSH key Pair\namazon.aws.ec2_key:\n  name: \"{{ ec2_key_name }}\"\n  state: present\n\nSave private key locally\ncopy:\n  content: \"{{\nkey_result.key.private_key }}\"\n  dest: \"./keys/{{ ec2_key_name\n}}.pem\"\n  mode: '0600'\n#0600 = only I can read it SSH will\nfail if permissions are wrong  ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "playbooks/provision.yml\n\nHow the playbook runs: run on local machine\n\nLoad Vault\nReuseable AWS credentials\n\nCreate SSH key Pair\namazon.aws.ec2_key:\n  name: \"{{ ec2_key_name }}\"\n  state: present\n\nSave private key locally\ncopy:\n  content: \"{{ key_result.key.private_key }}\"\n  dest: \"./keys/{{ ec2_key_name }}.pem\"\n  mode: '0600'\n#0600 = only I can read it SSH will fail if permissions are wrong  ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "m5ks7PJJd2Tlfohjz5zT6",
