      "seed": 852683714,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 1049537282,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1777734095406,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Reusable AWS credentials (smart trick)\naws_common: &aws_common\n  aws_access_key: \"{{ aws_access_key }}\"\n  aws_secret_key: \"{{ aws_secret_key }}\"\n  region: \"{{ aws_region }}\"\n👉 What is this?\n&aws_common = create a reusable block\nlater used with:\n<<: *aws_common\n\n👉 Means:\n\n“reuse these credentials everywhere”",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Reusable AWS credentials (smart trick)\naws_common: &aws_common\n  aws_access_key: \"{{ aws_access_key }}\"\n  aws_secret_key: \"{{ aws_secret_key }}\"\n  region: \"{{ aws_region }}\"\n👉 What is this?\n&aws_common = create a reusable block\nlater used with:\n<<: *aws_common\n\n👉 Means:\n\n“reuse these credentials everywhere”",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "bj2LsgvZl0yQPQZhe9IdO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2091.418746948244,
      "y": -1955.0787337662343,
      "width": 477.3999938964844,
      "height": 630,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b54",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 232706654,
      "version": 268,
      "versionNonce": 1296568926,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1777736651003,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Security Groups (firewall)\n\nWeb server SG -- Allows:\n22   → SSH\n80   → HTTP\n443  → HTTPS\nOpen to:\n0.0.0.0/0\n⚠️ Means:\n“anyone on internet”\n\nApp server SG -- Allows:\n22 → SSH\n8080 → app port (internal only)\nRestricted to:\n10.0.0.0/8\nMeans:\n“only inside network (VPC)",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Security Groups (firewall)\n\nWeb server SG -- Allows:\n22   → SSH\n80   → HTTP\n443  → HTTPS\nOpen to:\n0.0.0.0/0\n⚠️ Means:\n“anyone on internet”\n\nApp server SG -- Allows:\n22 → SSH\n8080 → app port (internal only)\nRestricted to:\n10.0.0.0/8\nMeans:\n“only inside network (VPC)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "3Fah8vbNForp0Om-VygJF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1573.2520802815775,
      "y": -1952.5787337662343,
      "width": 831.5999755859375,
      "height": 490,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b56",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 165165314,
      "version": 438,
      "versionNonce": 1301419678,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1777736651003,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Launch EC2\n\nWeb server SG \nname: ansible-demo-webserver\ninstance type and AMI and key name -> from group_vars\nassign_public_ip: true\n>Needed to access from internet\n>Public IPs assigned to running EC2 instances are free\nwait: true\n>Wait until instance is ready\nexact_count: 1 #Running twice = no duplicates\n>“only 1 instance exists”\nGet IPs\nweb_instance_result.instances[0].public_ip_address",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Launch EC2\n\nWeb server SG \nname: ansible-demo-webserver\ninstance type and AMI and key name -> from group_vars\nassign_public_ip: true\n>Needed to access from internet\n>Public IPs assigned to running EC2 instances are free\nwait: true\n>Wait until instance is ready\nexact_count: 1 #Running twice = no duplicates\n>“only 1 instance exists”\nGet IPs\nweb_instance_result.instances[0].public_ip_address",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
