      "updated": 1777825321968,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "It tells Ansible to\ncreate host groups\nbased on specific EC2\ntags.\n\ntags.Role: Creates\ngroups prefixed with\ntag_Role_ (e.g.,\ntag_Role_webserver,\ntag_Role_appserver).",
      "fontSize": 25.866666666666674,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "It tells Ansible to create host groups based on specific EC2 tags.\n\ntags.Role: Creates groups prefixed with tag_Role_ (e.g., tag_Role_webserver, tag_Role_appserver).",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
