      "text": "playbooks/configure.yml\n\nCommon config → ALL servers\nRun the common role on BOTH web and\napp servers\n\nsets login banner\ninstalls basic tools (vim, curl,\netc.)\nupdates system\ncreates admin user",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "playbooks/configure.yml\n\nCommon config → ALL servers\nRun the common role on BOTH web and app servers\n\nsets login banner\ninstalls basic tools (vim, curl, etc.)\nupdates system\ncreates admin user",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
